{
  "slug": "anti-ai-writing",
  "name": "Anti Ai Writing",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Edits any draft to remove the words, phrases, and structures that mark writing as AI output. Strips banned words like delve, unlock, leverage, robust, harness, and showcase (plus 50 more). Strips banned phrases like \"in today's fast-paced world\" and \"unlock the potential of.\" Strips banned structures: em dashes, the default rule of three, bulleted lists with bold titles, formulaic transitions, weak verbs. Returns a clean rewrite plus a diagnosis of what was wrong. Works in English and Spanish.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `anti-ai-writing` (Edits any piece of writing to remove AI tells).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install anti-ai-writing@claude-community` from `avectats7/anti-ai-writing`.\n\nYour reader can spot AI writing within a sentence. \"Delve,\" \"unlock the potential of,\" em dashes, the rule of three, \"in today's fast-paced world.\" Once the reader notices, you lose them. This skill is the fix. Paste a draft. Get back a version that does not read like a chatbot.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
